# basement - 124bpm, warm dorian bassline, offbeat hats
bpm 124
swing 20
humanize kick 4
humanize hat 4
humanize oh 4
humanize clap 4
humanize snare 4
humanize perc 4
humanize bass 4
humanize stab 4
kick x...x...x...x...
hat .x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x
tune hat 9000
oh ..x...x...x...x.
gain oh 0.7
clap ....x.......x...
bass a1! b1 d2! a1 . f#1 g1 a1 f#1! g1 . . . a1 . .
filter bass lp 700 res 0.5
sidechain bass 0.5
